  m_Text: "Hold W to move; release W to stop.\nA / D or arrow keys  \u2022  LEFT / RIGHT\nSpace  \u2022  JUMP\nE  \u2022  ACTIVATE nearby gateways\n\nTouch Journey Tokens to collect them.\nTokens are optional\u2014take your time.\nWatch the effort meter. At the cap, REST\nis recommended. There are no penalties.\n\nHardware: LEFT, RIGHT, JUMP, GRAB,\nACTIVATE; processed effort 0\u2013100.\nGRAB is reserved; no grab action is required."
